      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of building on nothing is a terrifying prospect, and it's understandable that the pressure to \"find meaning\" feels hollow when everything has dissolved. That feeling of purposelessness is a very real and heavy weight to carry. If you're feeling like stopping the performance is the only honest option, that's a signal that you need immediate, real support. Please consider calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or calling 111 in the UK; they are there to listen without judgment.",
